# {{name}}

A C++ mod for {{game}}, built against the engine's mod ABI (`engine/mod/abi.hpp`) and the game's
mod API (`{{game_header}}`).

```sh
ge mod build            # the package in build/mods/{{name}}/, checked as the game loads it
ge mod check build/mods/{{name}}
ge mod pack build/mods/{{name}} <another platform's build>...   # one package, several platforms
```

The rules a mod keeps (no clock, no globals, the game's random stream and libm through the table,
its whole state in its state block) are the engine's `docs/mods.md` § Determinism.
